{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1815.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"ca487a4f3f2ebb464a010121bf6ae2dbc9afa1b96257ba726741414e5de09ef9","ja":"今回は、島原さんの勝利です。\n最後の大逆転が見事でした。……ぱちぱちぱち。","zh":"这次是岛原小姐获胜。\n最后的大逆转真是精彩。……啪啪啪。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1815.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"54ba32c6c90a1a602a49a262a279a259be948ef5f6fdb00003ed0da2b917aa1e","ja":"やった～！　ポーカーって楽しいネ♪","zh":"太棒啦～！玩扑克真开心呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1815.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"cdd019a8fb53c8fe0e399ba33f8233f8eae259c5408edc8395bdcfe66396bf5f","ja":"それにしても、瑞希ちゃんのディーラーもすっかり\n板についてきたね！　バッチリだったよ！","zh":"话说回来，瑞希的荷官也越来越像样了呢！表现得非常棒！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1815.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"f6aa44bf7e76553f9b22e5bb280e54ab5dadccb521952fb7dbac5fb588647027","ja":"お、おかげで私も……\n楽しくポーカー、できました。","zh":"多、多亏了您……\n我也开心地玩了一局扑克。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1815.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"a626af9d7aed1d6c41fe7789a41aba0cbfc2f7e19ca5ebf4b09d42614a85d278","ja":"いえ、私の方こそ、ありがとうございました。","zh":"不，我才要谢谢您。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1815.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"adb934c9a17fea626709a7999a2753a07c71ad596c2951326d1e3a8c5ba6b7ff","ja":"練習もさせてもらえましたし、ポーカーも\n楽しかったです。ですので、最後にお礼を……。","zh":"还让我练习了，扑克也玩得很开心。所以，最后请允许我道声谢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1815.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"2808c8317f58b1c4748a53ad2ec6b08e21737a40297da079d9d04c2a740998e1","ja":"シュッ、シュッ、シュッ……","zh":"咻、咻、咻……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1815.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"6000b1cabe5c330c491fe0fd4a24d3e1b2815d4f84a559dbbb391fe24f87b838","ja":"わあ、すごく綺麗なピッチング……\n2枚とも、ぴったりそろってるよ！","zh":"哇，好漂亮的投球……\n2张全都整整齐齐的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1815.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"91252d93bb99a9f9d60b5eaf48e4f661161c71c538a14b46babe4a48ffb98244","ja":"す、すごいですね……。\nでも……どうして、トランプを配ったんですか？","zh":"好、好厉害啊……。\n不过……为什么要发扑克牌呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1815.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"68b787d9486c58554c6b22a6ea1c2eac9dfcaa6638e65478d73721e71119b661","ja":"もう1回やるノ？\nでも、それだとお礼って感じじゃないよネ？","zh":"还要再来1次吗？  \n不过，那样就不像是在道谢了吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1815.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"bef63c6d23be2597166761f4bd3d1728a8a9b3382c43d90e3fd1e8e316cdbcf5","ja":"ふふふ。\nではみなさん、カードを裏返してください。","zh":"呵呵呵。\n那么，请各位把卡片翻过来。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1815.unity3d","item_key":"commands[51].text","source_sha256":"a0fd18bab560dbbc3054d2d93ee9ff83dc71be71d5394b7d764eb6c80b7211fc","ja":"えっ！？\n2枚とも、ジョーカーになってる！？","zh":"咦！？\n2张全都变成小丑牌了！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1815.unity3d","item_key":"commands[52].text","source_sha256":"a801ae9a200d8a8815ae31ff2f22ac7131c35cc08fa71cf3d0a9dd9e588f208c","ja":"さ、さっきまで、ポーカーしてたトランプで……\nシャッフルも、してなかったのに……！？","zh":"刚、刚才还在用来打扑克的扑克牌……  \n明明连洗牌都没洗过……！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
